     from the centre against a safe radius of 33 dp, so 3.21 dp of margin. Everything else in this
     file reaches the edge or lies outside the mask on purpose: sky, hill, ground, asphalt, centre
     line, snowflakes are background that bleeds under any launcher mask, and clipping them is the
